* [**Updated**] [Atmosphere 788546f](https://github.com/rashevskyv/Kefirosphere) — Updated Atmosphere:
    * Support for firmware 23.0.0 has been officially merged into upstream `master` (the patches we previously integrated are now part of the official upstream repository).
    * Implemented official compressed NRO decompression (LZ4 frame format) for HOS 23.0.0+ and fixed bugs in the `ro` service (hexkyz commit `58f2b963d`).
