    * [PR #2852](https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere/pull/2852): fixed swapped path lengths when renaming files in `htcfs`.
    * [**Details about changes in the original Atmosphere**](https://github.com/Atmosphere-NX/Atmosphere/commits/master)

